# Basemap tile provider for the NRO Lookup map (src/data/mapTiles.js).
#
# Leave both unset and the map uses Esri World Street Map: no key, no signup,
# no watermark, English labels worldwide. Set one of these only if you want to
# switch providers.
#
# Copy to .env.local for local dev. For the deployed site, add the value as a
# GitHub Actions repository secret and pass it through in deploy.yml — do NOT
# commit a real key to this repo.

# CARTO Voyager — restores the map's original look.
# Free key (5M tile requests/month): https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey/
# VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=

# Stadia Maps Alidade Smooth — key can be locked to rs.rdmtoolkit.ca in the
# Stadia dashboard, so it is safe to expose in a static bundle.
# Free tier covers non-commercial/academic use: https://client.stadiamaps.com/signup/
# VITE_STADIA_API_KEY=
